OL,3,GNEWSAWorkers wade into lagoon to clear
OL,4,Aalgae
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlgae is being removed from a lagoon
OL,7,Fafter a large bloom developed during
OL,8,Fthe recent prolonged spell of hot
OL,9,Fweather.
OL,11,FTeams from Bournemouth, Christchurch
OL,12,Fand Poole (BCP) Council began clearing
OL,13,Fthe algae from Poole Park on Wednesday
OL,14,Ffollowing testing work last week.
OL,16,FWorkers in protective clothing have
OL,17,Fbeen collecting algae by hand and using
OL,18,Fa mini excavator to remove larger
OL,19,Famounts out of the lake.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
