OL,3,GNEWSAWorkers wade into lagoon to clear
OL,4,Aalgae
OL,5,
OL,6,FPortfolio holder for the environment
OL,7,FAndy Hadley said: "We know how much
OL,8,Fresidents and visitors value Poole Park
OL,9,Fand understand concerns about the
OL,10,Fbuild-up of algae in the lagoon."
